WEBVTT

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:47.830
Your Highness!

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:47.830
Himiko-sama!

00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:49.830
Don't.

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:53.700
I must prevent the ashes 
from corrupting the ley lines,

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.800
no matter what the cost!

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:06.760
Himiko...

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:51.600
So, is this all happening
 the way you imagined it?

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:52.940
Oh?

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:55.030
I don't know what you mean.

00:02:55.030 --> 00:02:56.400
Don't take me for a fool.

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.760
You're the one who goaded Mitsu, too.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:04.200
I simply listened to Sir Mitsuhide's
 concerns with a sympathetic ear.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:05.450
I don't like it when people split hairs.

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:08.420
If you insist on bluffing 
your way through this...

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:16.830
This is all in order to
 decipher the truth of this world.

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:18.630
The truth...

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:21.440
You mentioned that before.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:24.830
Is this it?

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:29.280
Indeed. Right now,
 it is only a collection of sketches.

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:32.840
But this is the result of a 
lifetime's worth of research.

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:35.820
It depicts the elements 
that constitute our world

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:39.720
and those who wield them.

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:43.060
Should we progress toward the future in 
the exact manner that I have depicted,

00:03:43.520 --> 00:03:45.890
it would mean that I have stood at the gateway

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:48.080
that leads to deciphering the truth of this world.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.310
That's bullshit!

00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:53.590
The moment I arrived on 
this star with Jeanne,

00:03:53.590 --> 00:03:56.870
you became a part of
 that bullshit, Sir Nobunaga.

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:04.740
This ash is a material
 necessary for the renewal of the world,

00:04:05.670 --> 00:04:06.850
its primordial essence.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:12.530
I believe King Arthur's goal
 is to collect it in the Holy Grail

00:04:12.530 --> 00:04:14.310
and recreate the world.

00:04:14.740 --> 00:04:17.420
You're telling me that I 
must live in such a world?

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:20.160
I doubt His Majesty would 
permit such an exception.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:23.530
The only beings the
 new world will accept

00:04:23.920 --> 00:04:25.610
will most likely be
 the Savior-King himself,

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:29.400
and the Perfecta,
 who exist between life and death.

00:04:31.220 --> 00:04:32.980
As though the world
 was his own walled garden...

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:38.130
It is human nature to find
 even such a world as that pleasant,

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:39.680
when it's given to them.

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:49.080
We have little time left.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:51.550
If we believe what da Vinci said,

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:56.880
Arthur will soon remake this 
world into one of his own design.

00:04:57.380 --> 00:04:58.060
Himiko...

00:04:58.670 --> 00:05:01.590
You will storm the Palais 
Natura with Azuchi, right?

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:04.070
Very well, leave that to me.

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:07.070
How will we get past the enemy's defenses?

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:08.550
It's simple.

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:10.740
We will activate the Ladder of Heaven

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:12.850
and teleport directly into the Palais.

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:14.810
W-Wait a second.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:17.510
Azuchi's massive. It'll stand out too much.

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:19.580
It'll be a big fat target 
before it even gets close.

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:20.920
I'll handle it.

00:05:22.170 --> 00:05:25.390
I'll lead the frontal assault 
with Goku and open a way.

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:27.870
You don't need to use 
anything like the Azuchi!

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:30.050
Don't talk about Azuchi that way!

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:31.510
Not another word!

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:42.470
Hideyoshi must just be in a foul mood.

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:45.240
More importantly, let's get Azuchi moving.

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.090
No.

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:48.480
Himiko's...

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:52.980
Himiko is at her limit.

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:01.620
If she uses the Ladder of Heaven,

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:04.030
she'll die!

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:06.360
N-Now is no time for joking around!

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:09.410
Why would you even think such a thing?

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:10.370
Stop it already.

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:14.130
I can't stand this anymore.

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:23.330
Himiko...

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:35.890
My betrothed...

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:38.430
I will keep Azuchi docked at the castle.

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:40.050
I forbid anyone to move it.

00:06:40.050 --> 00:06:41.240
My betrothed!

00:06:41.240 --> 00:06:45.150
We can just fight our way 
through King Arthur's forces.

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:49.210
Nobunaga!

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:52.970
Lend me the key to Caesar's Regalia!

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:55.870
That'll allow my Orléans to ride a wing-horse.

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:58.140
I can use the protection 
regalia to deploy a barrier

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:01.480
so that Orléans and The Fool can
 penetrate enemy ranks at lightning speed.

00:07:01.880 --> 00:07:02.980
Ranmaru...

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:07.990
Let me help you assault 
Palais Natura, too! Please!

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:11.020
All right.

00:07:11.020 --> 00:07:14.210
Hey, are you saying I'm 
not enough to do the job?

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:15.680
Of course you aren't.

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:17.730
I can't leave it all in the
 hands of just one monkey.

00:07:18.510 --> 00:07:21.090
Only Nobu-sama can call me a monkey!

00:07:21.090 --> 00:07:22.230
You're going to pay!

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:25.580
We'll have to race each
 other to King Arthur's castle, then!

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:26.510
Fine by me.

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:29.990
Monkey!

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:33.520
Punch me.

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:38.670
Even though she calls me her betrothed,

00:07:38.670 --> 00:07:41.360
I am the one who pushed her this far.

00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:43.260
I can't forgive myself!

00:07:45.850 --> 00:07:46.840
Punch me.

00:07:57.760 --> 00:08:02.710
If I didn't hold back, I'd go too far.

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:03.550
Monkey...

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:10.340
I'm starting to see Asahi in Himiko...

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:28.160
We have one objective:
 take King Arthur's head.

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:30.670
Monkey! Ranmaru! Let's go!

00:08:32.660 --> 00:08:35.130
Ichihime, Caesar,

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:37.830
give me strength.

00:08:54.250 --> 00:08:55.250
Asahi...

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:57.390
Your bro's going to give it his best shot.

00:08:58.120 --> 00:08:59.780
Goku, out!

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:04.810
Let it resound like thunder!

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:18.760
My betrothed... may fortune go with you.

00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:23.060
Lady Himiko, your health
 will suffer if you don't rest.

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:26.200
Don't you want to dissect
 me sooner, rather than later?

00:09:26.200 --> 00:09:28.330
False sincerity doesn't become you.

00:09:28.590 --> 00:09:33.340
To risk one's life is not
 the same as wasting it.

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:44.670
What does this card mean?

00:09:44.670 --> 00:09:47.580
The World, reversed.

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:51.090
Things will come to a standstill, 
leading to a deadlock.

00:09:51.590 --> 00:09:52.780
Also...

00:09:57.110 --> 00:09:59.090
A love shall go unrequited.

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:06.500
You're not worthy to face me!

00:10:13.690 --> 00:10:15.310
Give up already!

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:38.310
Monkey!

00:10:38.310 --> 00:10:38.970
Hideyoshi!

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:44.370
You will go no farther.

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:46.090
Damn it...

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:57.390
Nobu-sama, I've got this!

00:10:57.650 --> 00:10:59.730
Don't die, Monkey!

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:04.990
Fight me, Nobunaga!

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:05.890
Hold it!

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:08.830
That's as far as you get to go!

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:18.510
Like I said, you're mine, underling!

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:24.410
You've got millions of years to go 
before you get to fight Nobu-sama!

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:25.910
You wild monkey!

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:34.760
You don't look like
 you're doing so hot, old man!

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:41.930
Looks like I don't have a 
lot of breathing room, either.

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:19.880
Uesugi Kenshin and Visra have arrived!

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:21.780
Lord Kenshin!

00:12:23.040 --> 00:12:25.810
Yet another one who refuses to die.

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:29.920
I'm glad we meet again, General Alexander.

00:12:41.380 --> 00:12:43.190
Accepting one's weakness,

00:12:43.190 --> 00:12:45.510
as well as another's strength,

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:47.400
is the path to greater power.

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:49.470
I, Kenshin, the One-Eyed Dragon,

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:52.300
have been freed of the arrogance that
 made me think I could beat a dragon,

00:12:52.300 --> 00:12:54.440
and have come to realize my weakness.

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:57.260
No matter how many times you
 may be reborn, nothing will change.

00:12:57.260 --> 00:13:00.440
The weak will never be the victor.

00:13:00.440 --> 00:13:04.310
Some things become visible
 only once you lose one's sight.

00:13:04.310 --> 00:13:08.990
What will you grasp with
 the limb you have almost lost?

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:16.930
Wow!

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:23.300
General Alexander,
 let us now settle the score!

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:33.890
Out of my way!

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:42.820
What the...

00:13:42.820 --> 00:13:45.320
They're the guys with the pompous names!

00:13:45.770 --> 00:13:47.850
Hannibal and Charlemagne...

00:13:47.850 --> 00:13:49.320
They exist between life and death...

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:50.630
They're Perfecta!

00:13:50.630 --> 00:13:54.310
We won't be stopped
 by such weak-hearted foes!

00:13:58.200 --> 00:13:59.620
You...!

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:02.680
Ranmaru!

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:05.870
My betrothed...

00:14:08.670 --> 00:14:10.110
Perfecta

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:14.610
cannot be defeated with conventional attacks.

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:17.850
No, Your Highness.

00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:20.190
If you command the Azuchi again...

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:34.100
You have all served me well.

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:44.380
I now give my final order 
as the Queen of Yamatai.

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:46.880
I see...

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:50.010
They may as well be monsters.

00:14:51.020 --> 00:14:51.890
Ranmaru!

00:14:57.670 --> 00:15:00.640
He sure doesn't think much of us.

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:04.430
His mind seems elsewhere.

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:07.540
Does he think us unworthy of his attention?

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:09.910
We'll show him!

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:27.460
Let me handle this.

00:15:27.950 --> 00:15:29.790
You go to King Arthur!

00:15:30.060 --> 00:15:31.950
I will never let you die!

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:34.330
I'd like to, but I don't 
think it's happening!

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:40.530
This is your end, Oda Nobunaga!

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:42.200
Alexander!

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:46.580
Destroyer-King, die so that 
you may serve King Arthur!

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:48.080
Nobu-sama!

00:15:56.920 --> 00:15:57.760
Azuchi?!

00:15:57.760 --> 00:15:58.690
Himiko?!

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:11.550
Don't, Himiko!

00:16:17.360 --> 00:16:20.980
Ladder of Heaven, to me!

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:42.960
Himiko!

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:57.980
Himiko!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:00.780
See?

00:17:00.780 --> 00:17:05.870
Azuchi is useful... is it not?

00:17:05.870 --> 00:17:06.860
Yes.

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:09.990
Was I...

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:12.890
a good bride?

00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:18.000
Yes, the best.

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:20.250
Ranmaru...

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:26.130
I... will be wed in the afterlife...

00:17:26.750 --> 00:17:32.020
with my betrothed... as a dragon.

00:17:33.560 --> 00:17:34.670
In this life, you will...

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:39.520
I wish you both...

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:44.530
...the best.

00:17:58.330 --> 00:17:59.650
Himiko!

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:17.560
Himiko...

00:18:20.900 --> 00:18:22.120
Your Highness!

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:23.930
Himiko-sama!

00:18:34.350 --> 00:18:35.340
Himiko...

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:38.800
I will not mourn your death just yet.

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:40.980
Once I defeat Arthur,

00:18:42.790 --> 00:18:45.210
I will return you to the earth.

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:54.450
Let's go.

00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:07.800
Entire mountains of
 corpses will rise around Nobu

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:09.850
and rivers of tears will flow.

00:19:10.070 --> 00:19:11.180
Mitsuhide?!

00:19:11.620 --> 00:19:14.850
I must apologize to you.

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:18.650
Apologize? For what?

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:22.020
You are the Destroyer-King,
 the one who ends everything.

00:19:23.000 --> 00:19:27.340
Only the dead and the
 grieving will be left in your wake.

00:19:27.340 --> 00:19:31.490
But the one who made you the Destroyer-King

00:19:31.490 --> 00:19:33.050
is none other than I myself.

00:19:33.050 --> 00:19:35.370
What did Arthur brainwash you with?

00:19:35.720 --> 00:19:36.920
Oh, right.

00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:39.630
I have to apologize for one more thing.

00:19:40.720 --> 00:19:42.880
I am the one who killed Nobukatsu-sama.

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:47.710
I pulled the trigger with my own hand.

00:19:48.030 --> 00:19:52.890
I still can't get Nobukatsu-sama's
 face as he lay dying out of my mind.

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:53.890
That's enough!

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:56.390
Nobukatsu-sama was...

00:19:56.390 --> 00:19:57.640
Enough, Mitsu!

00:19:57.970 --> 00:20:01.760
If you say any more,
 I will have to kill you.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:03.810
Why did you do such thing?

00:20:04.400 --> 00:20:05.370
Why?

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:08.350
It was to protect Nobu, of course.

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:11.280
If I hadn't, Nobu would have been killed!

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:12.410
I see...

00:20:13.070 --> 00:20:15.800
We'll settle this after dealing with Arthur.

00:20:15.800 --> 00:20:16.910
I can't let you do that.

00:20:18.450 --> 00:20:21.920
King Arthur is needed in this world.

00:20:22.790 --> 00:20:28.120
Only King Arthur will bring
 salvation to this world full of sin.

00:20:28.780 --> 00:20:29.930
Nobu,

00:20:29.930 --> 00:20:32.830
the world we dreamed 
of will become reality.

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:33.840
Mitsuhide...

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:36.200
That's not our dream!

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:37.480
That's Arthur's.

00:20:37.930 --> 00:20:39.460
To unify heaven and earth is a dream all of us

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:42.010
who share the same goal can share.

00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:44.540
That's what Ichihime said.

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:49.220
That means it can be 
accomplished by King Arthur.

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:53.550
I would've rather heard you
 say you'd do it yourself instead.

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:55.340
If Monkey heard this,

00:20:55.340 --> 00:20:57.340
he'd beat you to a pulp.

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:05.600
Jeanne Kaguya d'Arc,
 maiden of prophecy, you must proclaim

00:21:06.060 --> 00:21:08.970
that King Arthur is the Savior-King.

00:21:08.970 --> 00:21:11.070
If not, I will kill Nobu.

00:21:11.070 --> 00:21:12.250
Mitsuhide!

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:14.050
Are you an idiot?

00:21:14.050 --> 00:21:16.180
As if I'd fear a pistol...

00:21:16.180 --> 00:21:17.390
Nobunaga!

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:20.810
Stop!

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:23.580
His head is next.

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:27.910
Don't, Ranmaru!

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:31.590
I, Jeanne Kaguya d'Arc...

00:21:31.590 --> 00:21:33.320
Don't listen to him!

00:21:36.420 --> 00:21:38.110
...hereby proclaim

00:21:38.670 --> 00:21:40.090
that King Arthur

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:43.600
is the Savior-King!

00:21:47.740 --> 00:21:50.610
All conditions have now been met.

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:56.480
What? The ash...

00:21:56.950 --> 00:21:58.610
What is this?

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:00.480
King Arthur...

00:22:04.630 --> 00:22:07.720
And now, this star will be saved!

00:22:12.570 --> 00:22:14.230
Jeanne d'Arc,

00:22:15.110 --> 00:22:18.400
I thank you for your final prophecy.

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:27.180
Nobuna...

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:30.420
Jeanne?!

00:22:32.420 --> 00:22:37.060
We will now begin the ritual 
to summon the Holy Grail.

00:24:11.580 --> 00:24:12.990
The dragon of destruction,

00:24:12.990 --> 00:24:14.420
the scent of death...

00:24:14.690 --> 00:24:16.310
The light of prophecy,

00:24:16.310 --> 00:24:17.840
the breath of life...

00:24:18.850 --> 00:24:21.370
The final episode: Judgement.

00:24:22.120 --> 00:24:24.900
Love, destroy this world!
